/P 133 0 R
/E (The broader takeaway is that procedural and administrative circulars will be upheld so long as they operate within the statutory scheme, and challenges to such circulars must clearly demonstrate lack of authority, procedural irregularity, or inconsistency with the parent Act.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
